{%- comment -%}
  ElmsNest S — the contact line (SIMPLIFY SPEC §5.4). Exactly ONE per page body, plus the footer's
  own mailto: the licensed sentence "לא בטוחים? נבדוק התאמה לפני שתזמינו." followed by the link
  "לשלוח תמונה של המקום ←" on a hairline underline, 44 px tap height.

  Usage: {% render 'elmsnest-s-contact' %}                      (home fit block, collection strip)
         {% render 'elmsnest-s-contact', product: product %}    (PDP not-for block)

  href = snippets/elmsnest-v2-photo-url.liquid, the theme's ONE mailto builder. Subject = the
  builder's default. Body = "שלום, מצרף/ת תמונה של המקום שרוצים להאיר." and, only when a product is
  given, " המוצר ששוקלים: {title}" is appended (the logic of elmsnest-v2-pdp-photo-cta). The line
  never names a channel; the phrase "תמונה של המקום" occurs once, in the link label (the body is
  URL-encoded, so it does not count as page text).

  Output: one <style> (tokens from elmsnest-v2-core) and one <p class="ens-contact">.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign ens_body = 'שלום, מצרף/ת תמונה של המקום שרוצים להאיר.'
  if product != blank
    assign ens_body = ens_body | append: ' המוצר ששוקלים: ' | append: product.title
  endif
-%}
{%- capture ens_href -%}{%- render 'elmsnest-v2-photo-url', body: ens_body -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign ens_href = ens_href | strip -%}
<style>
.ens-contact{margin:0;font-family:var(--env2-sans);font-weight:300;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55;color:var(--env2-ink-2);direction:rtl;text-align:start}
.ens-contact__a{position:relative;display:inline-block;padding-block:2px;font-weight:500;color:var(--env2-ink);text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:.3em;text-decoration-color:var(--env2-hair-btn);transition:color .3s,text-decoration-color .3s}
/* 44 px tap height without moving the underline off the text: the hit area is the pseudo-element */
.ens-contact__a::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset-block:-10px;inset-inline:-6px}
.ens-contact__a:hover,.ens-contact__a:focus-visible{color:var(--env2-glow);text-decoration-color:var(--env2-glow)}
.ens-contact__a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--env2-glow);outline-offset:4px}
.ens-contact__arrow{display:inline-block;margin-inline-start:.35em}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
  .ens-contact__a{transition:none}
}
</style>
<p class="ens-contact">לא בטוחים? נבדוק התאמה לפני שתזמינו. <a class="ens-contact__a" href="{{ ens_href }}">לשלוח תמונה של המקום<span class="ens-contact__arrow" aria-hidden="true">←</span></a></p>
